IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `fa-films`

-- Films Act 1981, ss 2, 6, 16, 21, 29-33, 38B and 40 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_films-act-1981.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

